<title>SRI LANKA: Kegalle 12-mth net up 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Kegalle 12-mth net up 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for Kegalle Plantations Ltd for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     707.77   vs    712.22</p>
<p>    Net profit	    98.02   vs     92.86</p>
<p>    Tax			1.00   vs	 -</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm is one of six privatised plantation firms, trading in Colombo. The company is a unit of the blue chip, John Keells Holdings.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
